A useful bit of math on 4-7-8 breathing: one cycle is 19 seconds, so the usual starting dose of 4 cycles takes about 76 seconds. That's it.

If the 7-second hold makes you lightheaded, keep the ratio and halve it: in 2, hold 3.5, out 4. Four cycles finish in under 40 seconds.

